---
title: Margarita
servings: 1
tags: [cocktail, tequila]
source: Our own
---

In a #cocktail shaker{}(with ice), pour @tequila{2%fl_oz}, @triple sec{1%fl_oz}, and @lime juice{0.75%fl_oz}(about a lime worth). Shake briskly for ~{10%seconds}, and strain into a #rocks glass{}(well chilled, with ice and a salted rim). Garnish with a @lime{1%wedge}.

> blanco tequila is preferred. Cointreau is preferred for triple sec.
